# wip380: the SONG screen has NO zoom: a turned knob (K1 bar, K2 pattern, K3 repeat) only highlights its cell.
wait 300
key b10 down
tap SEQ
key b10 up
tap OCT+
tapkey w0
tapkey w1
tapkey w2
tap OCT+
expect songmode 1
expect view 5
expect songlen 3
turn K3 1 80
shot songnozoom_k3.png
wait 200
expect songbar1.5 >31
turn K1 1 80
shot songnozoom_k1.png
wait 200
turn K2 1 80
shot songnozoom_k2.png
wait 200
expect view 5
